      <!-- Headline -->
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center flex flex-col items-center gap-4 mb-8 sm:mb-12">

        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight text-surface-900 dark:text-white leading-[1.1]">
          Compress ZIP File Online Free
        </h1>

        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-surface-500 dark:text-surface-400 font-normal leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
          Easily <strong>compress zip file size</strong> and reduce archives to a smaller size in seconds. Re-encode with Maximum DEFLATE Level 9, apply smart media compression to <strong>further compress zip file</strong> archives, or convert photos to WebP inside the ZIP. 100% private, free compress zip file tool.
