          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-[#131b2e] border border-surface-200 dark:border-surface-800 shadow-subtle">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-100 dark:bg-emerald-900/60 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm mb-4">
            2
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-surface-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Smart Media Re-compression</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-surface-500 dark:text-surface-400 leading-relaxed">
            Photos and graphics take up over 80% of archive space. Our smart engine re-encodes photos inside the ZIP so you can <strong>further compress zip file</strong> archives down to 100KB or 2MB easily.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-[#131b2e] border border-surface-200 dark:border-surface-800 shadow-subtle">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-purple-100 dark:bg-purple-900/60 text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-300 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm mb-4">
            3
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-surface-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Preserves 100% Hierarchy</h3>
