            When you <strong>compress zip file for free</strong> using our tool, your entire directory tree, subfolders, and non-image files (PDFs, docs, source code) stay 100% organized and intact.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Additional SEO Explanatory Content -->
      <div class="mt-12 p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-[#131b2e] border border-surface-200 dark:border-surface-800 space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-surface-900 dark:text-white">
          Why Use Our Free In-Browser ZIP Compressor?
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-surface-600 dark:text-surface-300 leading-relaxed">
          When searching for tools like <em>filetozip.com compress zip file online free</em>, many third-party web services require uploading your private files to an external server, creating privacy and security risks. With our <strong>online compress zip file</strong> utility, every byte is unpacked and optimized 100% locally in your web browser. There are no size caps, no watermarks, and no registration required.
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-2">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 dark:bg-emerald-900/60 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold flex-shrink-0">✓</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-surface-600 dark:text-surface-300"><strong>Compress zip file to smaller size</strong> without uploading data to any cloud or remote server.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
